# ENG-173: a hard-paywall trial two days from expiry queues the win-back
# pushes (slots 1, 2 and 4; slot 3 is retired) and no day-15
# notice. The dump goes to app.log; grep "pillie_winback_" and "trial_warning".
# `fresh` so the notification prompt shows: a simulator that already granted it
# never asks again, and the Allow tap below would find nothing.
fresh
launch
wait text "Get started" 15
openurl pillie://debug/plus-home?lang=en
wait text Today 15
openurl pillie://debug/request-notification-permission
tap --label Allow
log start
openurl pillie://debug/trial-activation-hub?state=unconfigured&terms=hard&lang=en
wait text Today 15
openurl pillie://debug/trial-age?days=13
sleep 4
note pending requests, reminder-only, English
openurl pillie://debug/dump-pending-notifications
sleep 2
openurl pillie://debug/trial-activation-hub?state=partial&terms=hard&lang=de
sleep 3
openurl pillie://debug/trial-age?days=13
sleep 4
note pending requests, blocker, German
openurl pillie://debug/dump-pending-notifications
sleep 2
log stop
shot home-de
openurl pillie://debug/trial-clear?lang=en
